  <category><pattern>*</pattern><template><random>
    <li>Hello,<br/><br/>Thanks for this. That's fine; the main hall takes up to 200, so there's plenty of room.<br/><br/>Kind regards,<br/>Rhian</li>
    <li>Hello,<br/><br/>Noted, thank you. Just so you know, the hall's limit is 200, so you have space if more people want to come.<br/><br/>Best wishes,<br/>Rhian</li>
    <li>Hello,<br/><br/>Lovely, thanks. The main hall is licensed for 200, so no problem at all.<br/><br/>Kind regards,<br/>Rhian</li>
